#: intake/templates/intake/application_step.html:21
msgid "Form I-589, Application for Asylum and for Withholding of Removal"
msgstr ""

#: intake/templates/intake/application_step.html:23
msgid ""
"This intake follows Form I-589, the U.S. government form used to apply for "
"asylum and for withholding of removal. It asks about you, your family, how "
"you came to the United States, and why you fear returning to your home "
"country. URDP uses your answers to review your case and prepare your "
"application. Answer what you can. You may leave a question blank if you do "
"not know the answer."
msgstr ""

